@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(c) (src:1070)
GIVEN `each constituent corporation has adopted and certified the agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 251(c) the agreement is then to be filed` `each constituent corporation has adopted and certified the agreement` MEANS
    `each constituent corporation has adopted and certified the agreement`

-- The surviving or resulting corporation may file a certificate of merger or consolidation instead of the agreement.
-- One field per limb (c)(1) to (c)(7).
-- src:1070 | In lieu of filing the agreement of merger or consolidation required by this section, the surviving or resulting corporation may file a certificate of merger or consolidation, executed in accordance with § 103 of this title …
