@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(d) (src:1078)
GIVEN constituent IS A `s 251(d) Effect of an amendment on one constituent corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 251(d) the amendment is barred as to the constituent corporation` constituent MEANS
        constituent's `its stockholders adopted the agreement before the amendment`
    AND (    constituent's `the amendment alters the amount or kind of shares, securities, cash, property or rights to be received for or on conversion of any of its shares`
          OR constituent's `the amendment alters a term or condition of the agreement and adversely affects the holders of a class or series of its stock`)

