§§ `s 251(e) the surviving corporation's certificate is amended by the merger`

-- src:1079 | (e) In the case of a merger, the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation shall automatically be amended to the extent, if any, that changes in the certificate of incorporation are set forth in the agreement of merger.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(e) (src:1079)
GIVEN kind                                                                  IS A `s 251 Kind of combination`
      `the agreement of merger sets forth changes in the certificate of incorporation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 251(e) the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation is automatically amended` kind `the agreement of merger sets forth changes in the certificate of incorporation` MEANS
    CONSIDER kind
    WHEN `a merger into a single surviving corporation`     THEN `the agreement of merger sets forth changes in the certificate of incorporation`
    WHEN `a consolidation into a new resulting corporation` THEN FALSE

§§ `s 251(a) read with (b), (c), (f), (g) and (h) -- approved in accordance with this section`

-- Plain gloss: a constituent corporation has approved the agreement "in accordance with this section" when its board has
-- adopted the resolution and either its stockholders adopted the agreement or no stockholder vote is necessary under
-- (f), (g) or (h). NOTHING (not covered) when the stockholders' vote cannot be counted and no exemption applies.
-- src:1061 | pursuant to an agreement of merger or consolidation, as the case may be, complying and approved in accordance with this section …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 251(a) (src:1061)
GIVEN `the board adopted the resolution s 251(b) requires`                IS A BOOLEAN
      `the stockholders adopted the agreement`                            IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `no vote of the stockholders is necessary under s 251(f), (g) or (h)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 251(a) the constituent corporation has approved the agreement in accordance with s 251` `the board adopted the resolution s 251(b) requires` `the stockholders adopted the agreement` `no vote of the stockholders is necessary under s 251(f), (g) or (h)` MEANS
    IF NOT `the board adopted the resolution s 251(b) requires`
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE IF `no vote of the stockholders is necessary under s 251(f), (g) or (h)`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         ELSE `the stockholders adopted the agreement`
